/// listRecordings, exportRecording, deleteRecording) is never logged. A value that would
/// pass the JSON-text bound or the line limit is replaced by the marker
/// {"omitted":"too_large","bytes":N}. Checked by validate-recording, not by this schema: t
/// never decreases, args and result parse as JSON, and call is not a plumbing call.
